<main id="main-content" tabindex="-1" class="mx-main">

{#- 2. Hero: the interactive Revenue Pipeline is the hero visual -#}
<section class="mx-hero" id="mxHero" aria-labelledby="mxHeroTitle">
  <div class="mx-hero__copy">
    <p class="mx-kicker" data-mx-hero-in>HubSpot Gold Solutions Partner</p>
    <h1 class="mx-display" id="mxHeroTitle">Make the CRM<br>work like the business.</h1>
    <p class="mx-hero__lead" data-mx-hero-in>You bought HubSpot. You still do not trust what it tells you. We rebuild it around how your business actually runs.</p>
    <div class="mx-hero__actions" data-mx-hero-in>
      <button type="button" class="mx-btn mx-btn--primary js-open-hs-form" data-mx-hover><span data-roll-label>Book a free consultation</span></button>
      <a href="/solutions/" class="mx-btn" data-mx-hover><span data-roll-label>See our solutions</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-hero__visual">
    <div class="console-wrap" id="heroConsole" data-inview>
      <div class="console" role="region" aria-label="Interactive revenue pipeline demo">
        <div class="console__body">
          <div class="console__bar">
            <div class="console__dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
            <div class="console__url">Revenue Pipeline</div>
            <span class="console__live" id="boardMode">Live</span>
          </div>
          {% include "partials/hero-console.njk" %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- 3. Founder intro -#}
<section class="mx-section mx-founder" aria-labelledby="mxFounderName">
  <div class="mx-container mx-founder__grid">
    <div class="mx-founder__id" data-mx-reveal>
      <picture><source srcset="/assets/img/allen-headshot.webp" type="image/webp"><img src="/assets/img/allen-headshot.png" alt="Allen Trinidad, founder of PipelineSync" width="900" height="1273" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></picture>
      <div><h2 id="mxFounderName">Allen Trinidad</h2><p>Founder, HubSpot Solutions Architect</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="mx-founder__text" data-mx-words>Before PipelineSync, I spent years as a HubSpot subject-matter expert supporting HubSpot Partner agencies. The same three sentences came up on almost every project: we are still working in spreadsheets, I do not trust the forecast, and we cannot tell which campaigns produced revenue. None of those are HubSpot problems. They are what happens when a CRM gets configured quickly, never architected, and never documented. PipelineSync exists to fix exactly that.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{#- 4. Pull quote -#}
<section class="mx-section mx-quote" aria-label="Founder quote">
  <div class="mx-container">
    <blockquote class="mx-quote__text">
      <p data-mx-roll>We work directly with you,</p>
      <p data-mx-roll>not through layers, to build a CRM</p>
      <p data-mx-roll>your team trusts and uses every day.</p>
    </blockquote>
    <div class="mx-quote__foot" data-mx-reveal>
      <cite>Allen Trinidad, Founder</cite>
      <a href="/about/" class="mx-btn" data-mx-hover><span data-roll-label>Read our story</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

