{#- 6. Process steps -#}
<section class="mx-process" id="mxProcess" aria-labelledby="mxProcessTitle">
  <div class="mx-container mx-process__inner">
    <div class="mx-process__left">
      <p class="mx-kicker">How we work</p>
      <h2 id="mxProcessTitle" class="mx-process__title">Audit, architect, build, hand over</h2>
      <div class="mx-roller" aria-hidden="true"><div class="mx-roller__list"><span>01 — Audit</span><span>02 — Architecture</span><span>03 — Build</span><span>04 — Handover</span></div></div>
      <div class="mx-process__bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i></div>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-process__right">
      <article class="mx-step"><span class="mx-step__num">01</span><h3>Audit</h3><p>We go through your portal, data model, integrations, and sales process. You get a written picture of what is working, what is broken, and what is costing you time.</p></article>
      <article class="mx-step"><span class="mx-step__num">02</span><h3>Architecture</h3><p>We design the data model, pipelines, lifecycle stages, permissions, and integration map before touching anything, and walk you through it for approval.</p></article>
      <article class="mx-step"><span class="mx-step__num">03</span><h3>Build</h3><p>We build and test in a sandbox first, then deploy. Workflows, custom code, integrations, dashboards, and safeguards.</p></article>
      <article class="mx-step"><span class="mx-step__num">04</span><h3>Handover</h3><p>Live training and written SOPs so your team owns the system. Documentation covers the data model, automation logic, integration map, and permissions.</p></article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{#- 7. Services track -#}
<section class="mx-work" id="mxWork" aria-labelledby="mxWorkTitle">
  <div class="mx-work__pin">
    <div class="mx-container mx-work__head">
      <p class="mx-kicker">What we do</p>
      <h2 class="mx-display-2" id="mxWorkTitle" data-mx-roll>Four things, done properly</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-work__track">
      {%- set work = [
        ["/solutions/hubspot-implementation/", "Implementation / 2–4 weeks", "HubSpot implementation and onboarding", "Objects, pipelines, lifecycle stages, permissions, automation, and reporting designed around your sales motion.", "fa-cubes", "1"],
        ["/solutions/hubspot-migration/", "Migration / 3–6 weeks", "CRM migration", "From Salesforce, Pipedrive, or a legacy system, with fields mapped, duplicates resolved, and history preserved where it matters.", "fa-right-left", "2"],
        ["/solutions/hubspot-crm-cleanup/", "Data quality / 1–2 weeks", "CRM cleanup and data quality", "Duplicate, incomplete, and conflicting records removed, then validation and governance so the mess does not come back.", "fa-broom", "3"],
        ["/solutions/revops/", "RevOps / 2–4 weeks", "RevOps infrastructure, lead to close", "Lifecycle stages, routing and SLAs, automation, attribution, and dashboards leadership can defend.", "fa-chart-line", "4"]
      ] -%}
      {%- for w in work %}
      <a class="mx-card" href="{{ w[0] }}">
        <div class="mx-card__media"><div class="mx-card__img mx-art mx-art--{{ w[5] }}" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fa-solid {{ w[4] }}"></i></div></div>
        <p class="mx-card__tag">{{ w[1] }}</p>
        <h3>{{ w[2] }}</h3>
        <p>{{ w[3] }}</p>
      </a>
      {%- endfor %}
      <div class="mx-work__more">
        <p class="mx-display-2">And many more</p>
        <p>Custom API integrations, HubSpot audits, ongoing administration, training and SOPs.</p>
        <a href="/solutions/" class="mx-btn" data-mx-hover><span data-roll-label>All solutions</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

